### 1. Registrar un nuevo usuario (Auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mauricio Gómez",
  "email": "mauricio@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "isNotificationEnabled": true
}

### 2. Login Exitoso
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mauricio@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login Fallido (Credenciales incorrectas -> 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mauricio@example.com",
  "password": "password_incorrecto"
}

### 4. Crear Reporte de Fuga de Agua (Guarda en BD y envía correo HTML)
POST http://localhost:3000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Av. Universidad 405, Col. Lomas del Campestre",
  "description": "Fuga severa de agua potable saliendo de banqueta frente a la entrada principal",
  "severity": "high",
  "reporterPhone": "4771234567"
}

### 5. Listar Todos los Reportes Guardados
GET http://localhost:3000/reports
